---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Testimonials from "../../components/Testimonials.astro";
import Contact from "../../components/Contact.astro";

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CreativeWork",
    "name": "AL'ARD — Making a beautiful story easy to buy",
    "description": "Conversion-focused redesign of AL'ARD's Palestinian olive oil store: new IA, mega menu, above-the-fold product pages and gifting. Now live.",
    "url": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/work/alard",
    "image": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/assets/img/og-alard.jpg",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Abdulaziz Abu Dhair",
      "url": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/"
    },
    "creator": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Abdulaziz Abu Dhair",
      "url": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/"
    },
    "genre": "E-commerce conversion redesign",
    "inLanguage": "en"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Work",
        "item": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/#case-studies"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 3,
        "name": "AL'ARD",
        "item": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/work/alard"
      }
    ]
  }
];
---
<Layout
  title="AL'ARD — Case Study · Abdulaziz Abu Dhair"
  description="Conversion-focused redesign of AL'ARD's Palestinian olive oil store: new IA, mega menu, above-the-fold product pages and gifting. Now live."
  path="/work/alard"
  ogType="article"
  ogImage="og-alard.jpg"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<article class="band band--light case" aria-labelledby="case-title">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#case-studies"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to portfolio</a>
    <header>
      <p class="case__eyebrow">E-commerce · Conversion Redesign</p>
      <h1 class="case__title" id="case-title">AL'ARD <span>Making a beautiful story easy to buy</span></h1>
      <dl class="case__meta">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>UX/UI Designer</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Responsive web — storefronts for the US, Europe &amp; Saudi Arabia</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Tools</dt><dd>Figma</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <figure class="case__media">
      <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-home-desktop-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-home-desktop-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-home-desktop-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1400" height="836" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="The redesigned AL'ARD homepage: a sticky header with search and categories above a hero for Palestinian olive oil.">
    </figure>

    <!-- 01 Overview -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-overview">
      <div class="case__body" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">01 — Overview &amp; role</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-overview">Heritage food, sold across three regions</h2>
          <p>AL'ARD sells Palestinian olive oil and artisan foods — heritage products tied closely to Palestinian identity — across regional storefronts for the US, Europe and Saudi Arabia.</p>
          <p><strong>My role:</strong> UX/UI designer responsible for the redesign across phases — homepage, product page, and a full collection and IA restructure across all three storefronts, on desktop and mobile.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">02 — The problem</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title">A beautiful story — that was hard to buy</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Pop-up overload.</strong> Homepages cluttered with stacked pop-ups competing for attention.</li>
            <li><strong>Buried navigation.</strong> Key categories hidden inside a desktop side menu.</li>
            <li><strong>Below the fold.</strong> Product image, price and size options all sat below the fold.</li>
            <li><strong>SEO debt.</strong> Audits across the three regional sites flagged structural issues.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>The brief:</strong> a conversion-focused redesign that makes shopping effortless on desktop and mobile — without diluting the brand's Palestinian heritage identity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="steps" aria-label="Process">
        <li><strong>Audit</strong><span>UX pain points &amp; SEO findings</span></li>
        <li><strong>Restructure</strong><span>Catalog &amp; IA around how people shop</span></li>
        <li><strong>Design</strong><span>Desktop + mobile screens</span></li>
        <li><strong>Prototype</strong><span>Interactive Figma prototype</span></li>
        <li><strong>Test</strong><span>Sessions with target users</span></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 IA -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-ia">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">03 — Key decision · Information architecture</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-ia">Organised around how customers shop — not how inventory is stored</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Nine navigation collections cover what people come for, while merchandising collections give seasonal and budget-led ways in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="collections">
        <div>
          <h3>Navigation collections</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Palestinian Olive Oil</li><li>Gift Boxes &amp; Bundles</li><li>Palestinian Pantry</li>
            <li>Za'atar, Herbs &amp; Spices</li><li>Kufiya &amp; Heritage</li><li>Nabulsi Soap</li>
            <li>Pickles &amp; Table Olives</li><li>Support Palestinian Farmers</li><li>Customer Favorites</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Merchandising collections</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Palestinian Breakfast Essentials</li><li>Gifts under $30</li><li>New Harvest</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-all-products-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-all-products-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-all-products-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1400" height="1213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AL'ARD All Products page with category, price and size filters beside a grid of olive oils and gift boxes.">
        <figcaption>All Products — filters by category, price and size.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 Navigation -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-nav">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">04 — Key decision · Navigation</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-nav">Every category, one click away — from any scroll position</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="features features--4 features--numbered">
        <li><strong>Sticky header</strong><span>Primary navigation moved out of the side menu into a header that stays with the shopper.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Mega menu by intent</strong><span>Shop by need, by size or by type — the way people actually decide.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Merchandising tile</strong><span>Seasonal hooks like "First Press of the Season" live right inside the menu.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Search-first header</strong><span>A wide search bar with helpful prompts: olive oil, za'atar, gift boxes.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-mega-menu-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-mega-menu-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-mega-menu-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1400" height="983" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The Palestinian Olive Oil mega menu, organised by need, size and type, with a First Press of the Season promotion.">
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- 05 Homepage -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-home">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">05 — Key decision · Homepage</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-home">A calmer homepage that sells</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="features features--3">
        <li><strong>Minimized pop-ups</strong><span>One clear message at a time instead of stacked overlays.</span></li>
        <li><strong>More products above the fold</strong><span>Best sellers surface in the very first scroll.</span></li>
        <li><strong>"Compare the Gifts"</strong><span>Guides buyers by budget and occasion — Mini, Pantry, Olive Oil, Premium.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cs-grid cs-grid--2">
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-best-sellers-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-best-sellers-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-best-sellers-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="1400" height="772" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Best Sellers row with olive oil, za'atar and tahini, each with size options and add to cart.">
          <figcaption>Best sellers, above the fold.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-collections-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-collections-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-collections-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="1400" height="686" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Shop by Collection grid: olive oil, gift boxes, za'atar and spices, pantry, kufiya and heritage.">
          <figcaption>Shop by collection — grouped by how people cook, gift and gather.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-compare-gifts-1592.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-compare-gifts-796.webp 796w, /assets/img/alard/alard-compare-gifts-1592.webp 1592w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1592" height="570" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Compare the Gifts module showing Mini, Pantry, Olive Oil and Premium gift tiers side by side.">
        <figcaption>Compare the Gifts — pick by budget &amp; occasion.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- 06 Product page -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-pdp">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">06 — Key decision · Product page</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-pdp">The product page, rebuilt around the fold</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-product-page-1512.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-product-page-756.webp 756w, /assets/img/alard/alard-product-page-1512.webp 1512w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1512" height="1104" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Olive oil product page with gallery, Halal and Harvest tags, rating, per-ml pricing, size cards, subscribe and save, and trust badges — all above the fold.">
      </figure>
      <ul class="features features--3 features--numbered">
        <li><strong>Gallery above the fold</strong><span>Hero image and thumbnails visible without scrolling.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Title, rating &amp; proof</strong><span>Halal and Harvest tags, rating and "300+ bought" up top.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Per-unit pricing</strong><span>Price per ml makes the bulk discount self-evident.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Size variants as cards</strong><span>Every size shows its own price and saving.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Subscribe &amp; Save</strong><span>One-time or recurring delivery in a single step.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Persistent trust badges</strong><span>Authentic Palestinian origin + free-shipping threshold.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 07 Conversion -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-aov">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">07 — Conversion &amp; order value</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-aov">Patterns for more — and bigger — orders</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Subscribe &amp; Save, bundles, reviews, a collapsible FAQ, related products, a build-your-own box and a free-shipping progress bar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-grid cs-grid--2">
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-bought-together-900.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-bought-together-450.webp 450w, /assets/img/alard/alard-bought-together-900.webp 900w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="900" height="610" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Frequently bought together: tahini paste and Medjool dates with a 10% bundle discount.">
          <figcaption>Frequently bought together.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-cart-drawer-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-cart-drawer-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-cart-drawer-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="1400" height="983" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Cart drawer showing a free-shipping progress bar and loyalty points.">
          <figcaption>Cart drawer — free-shipping progress &amp; loyalty points.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-build-box-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-build-box-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-build-box-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="1400" height="756" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Build Your Own Box: choose five to ten items, with a box summary that unlocks a discount at five.">
          <figcaption>Build Your Own Box — the discount unlocks at five items.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-reviews-1520.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-reviews-760.webp 760w, /assets/img/alard/alard-reviews-1520.webp 1520w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 674px, (min-width: 721px) 47vw, 94vw" width="1520" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Customer reviews tab with a rating breakdown and trust seals.">
          <figcaption>Reviews preview with rating breakdown &amp; trust seals.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 08 Gifting & B2B -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-gift">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">08 — Gifting &amp; B2B</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-gift">A dedicated path for gifting — and for business</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="features features--3">
        <li><strong>Gift tiers</strong><span>By budget &amp; occasion, compared side by side.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Add-ons</strong><span>Kufiya, dates, Nabulsi soap, tree sponsorship, gift card.</span></li>
        <li><strong>B2B</strong><span>Corporate &amp; bulk gifting with custom branding and multi-address shipping.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-gift-boxes-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-gift-boxes-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-gift-boxes-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1400" height="840" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Palestinian Gift Boxes collection page hero with a boxed olive oil and pantry set.">
      </figure>
      <figure class="cs-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-bulk-gifting-1400.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-bulk-gifting-700.webp 700w, /assets/img/alard/alard-bulk-gifting-1400.webp 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 1448px) 1368px, 94vw" width="1400" height="454" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Corporate and bulk gifting banner: Gift Palestine, at scale.">
        <figcaption>Corporate &amp; bulk gifting — "Gift Palestine, at scale."</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- 09 Visual language -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-visual">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">09 — Visual language</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-visual">A visual language rooted in the land</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Built from the AL'ARD brand guidelines, with the secondary palette used sparingly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-system">
        <div>
          <h3>Colour</h3>
          <ul class="swatches">
            <li class="swatch"><i style="background:#a2b52d"></i><span>Olive Leaf<small>#A2B52D</small></span></li>
            <li class="swatch"><i style="background:#56632c"></i><span>Grove Green<small>#56632C</small></span></li>
            <li class="swatch"><i style="background:#ceb04b"></i><span>Harvest Gold<small>#CEB04B</small></span></li>
            <li class="swatch"><i style="background:#000"></i><span>Black<small>#000000</small></span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Typography</h3>
          <ul class="type-list">
            <li><b>Aa</b><span>Begum<small>Display &amp; headlines</small></span></li>
            <li><b>Aa</b><span>Frutiger Neue<small>UI &amp; body</small></span></li>
            <li><b lang="ar">أرض</b><span>Noto Kufi Arabic<small>Arabic</small></span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-product-card-407.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-product-card-204.webp 204w, /assets/img/alard/alard-product-card-407.webp 407w" sizes="260px" width="407" height="676" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Product card component with a Harvest 2026 tag, size chips, price and add to cart button." style="max-width:260px">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 10 Responsive -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-mobile">
      <div class="cs-section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">10 — Desktop &amp; mobile</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-mobile">One system — fully responsive, desktop to mobile</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Every section was designed in desktop (1512) and mobile (393) variants — from the header and mega menu to filters and the footer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-grid cs-grid--phones">
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-home-mobile-625.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-home-mobile-313.webp 313w, /assets/img/alard/alard-home-mobile-625.webp 625w" sizes="(min-width: 721px) 300px, 31vw" width="625" height="1222" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Mobile homepage hero.">
          <figcaption>Home</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-menu-625.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-menu-313.webp 313w, /assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-menu-625.webp 625w" sizes="(min-width: 721px) 300px, 31vw" width="625" height="1222" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Mobile drill-down navigation menu.">
          <figcaption>Drill-down menu</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-filters-962.webp" srcset="/assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-filters-481.webp 481w, /assets/img/alard/alard-mobile-filters-962.webp 962w" sizes="(min-width: 721px) 300px, 31vw" width="962" height="1880" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Mobile filters presented as a bottom sheet.">
          <figcaption>Filters as a bottom sheet</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 11 Outcome -->
    <section class="cs-section" aria-labelledby="s-outcome">
      <div class="case__body" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">11 — Outcome</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title" id="s-outcome">Validated before a line of code — now live</h2>
          <p>Before development, I built an interactive prototype and tested it with users from the target segments. The sessions showed clear improvement over the old experience — and the redesigned storefront is now live at <a href="https://www.alardproducts.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">alardproducts.com</a>.</p>
          <ul class="outcome-points" aria-label="What testing showed">
            <li>Faster navigation</li>
            <li>Quicker product discovery</li>
            <li>Less confusion around fit</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="cs-eyebrow">Reflection</p>
          <h2 class="cs-title">Reconciling priorities that don't naturally agree</h2>
          <p>A conversion redesign isn't just a visual refresh. Business goals, real usability for a wide audience, SEO requirements across three regional sites, and what the dev stack could support all pulled in different directions — most of the work was making sure no single priority won at the expense of the others, while keeping the brand's Palestinian heritage front and centre.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="pull-quote">
        <p>“He understands the direction well, is responsive to feedback, and has been helping translate our ideas into a clearer and more user-friendly website experience.”</p>
        <footer><cite>Ahmad AlNimr</cite> — Digital Marketing Manager, AL'ARD</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>

<Testimonials />

<Contact />
</Layout>
